     <td style=\"width:400px;\">\n              \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/667c7b5ab458d55a15346991.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"400\">\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n          </tbody>\n\n        </table>\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n     \n    <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;border-width:0px;margin:0px auto 0px auto;border-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;border-radius:0px;\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-top:10px;border-color:transparent;direction:ltr;font-size:0px;text-align:center;\">\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The Hidden Deal Killer You\u2019re Probably Ignoring</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Hi Sara,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Want to know one of the top reasons business sales die at the last minute?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The landlord.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">No one thinks about them until they\u2019re the only thing standing between you and closing\u2014and by then, you have zero leverage.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">This week, I saw a deal collapse days before closing because of a lease issue. The buyers were relocating, everything was lined up\u2026 and then they realized they had to personally guarantee the lease. Just like that, the deal was dead.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Why Landlords Hold All the Cards</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If your business is in a prime location, the landlord knows they can fill that space instantly. So why should they rush to approve a new tenant?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">They don\u2019t need to play ball, and if you wait too long to negotiate, they\u2019ll have all the power.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>How to Avoid This Mess</strong></span><br></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Get the landlord involved early. Yes, confidentiality matters, but waiting until the end gives them every reason to say no.</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Know that personal guarantees are standard. If you\u2019re hoping to avoid one, be prepared to prepay rent or put up extra security.</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you\u2019re a seller, don\u2019t assume the lease transfer will be easy. Buyers might be excited to take over your business, but if the landlord refuses to assign the lease, the deal is dead.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Lessons from the Trenches</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">I\u2019ve seen deals where landlords have:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Refused to assign a lease because they liked the current tenant and didn\u2019t want to risk a change.</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Rejected SBA-required lease terms, which make the bank the first priority if the business defaults. Landlords hate this.</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Changed their mind at the last second, leaving the buyer stranded.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you\u2019re in a transaction right now, consider this your warning shot\u2014figure out the lease situation before you\u2019re deep into due diligence.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you want more insights on how to keep your deal from falling apart at the finish line, </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/39ebea035b0?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: #3425db !important; font-size: 14px; color: #3425db !important\">check out our course offerings on Deal Academy.</span></a></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">To deals that actually close,<br>Sara Sharp<br>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Business Consultant &amp; Founder of Deal Academy</span></p><p><strong><em>P.S. If you're looking to buy or sell an accounting firm, and want me to keep an eye out for you, </em></strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/e172b5f02c5?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>fill out this form here</em></strong></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>.</em></strong></span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/45fb65108f6?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </sp